      "instance_name": "wife_look_scene",
      "label": "wife giving a look",
      "description": "A scene where a woman (interpreted as a wife) gives a calm, slightly disapproving look to the viewer, implied to be her husband returning home. The text overlays describe the context: 'when you come home from a long day of suicide bombin' and 'and your wife gives you this look'. The woman is the central participant, positioned in the foreground, and her expression is the focal point of the scene.",
